- SQLAlchemy, https://www.sqlalchemy.org/ (MIT)
- Alembic, https://alembic.sqlalchemy.org/ (MIT)
- Psycopg, https://www.psycopg.org/psycopg3/ (LGPL-3.0)
- HTTPX, https://www.python-httpx.org/ (BSD-3-Clause)
