- node:20-alpine (build stage only), https://hub.docker.com/_/node (MIT)
- nginx:1.27-alpine, https://hub.docker.com/_/nginx (BSD-2-Clause)
- ollama/ollama:0.6.8, optional "llm" profile, https://github.com/ollama/ollama (MIT)
- Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct weights, optional, downloaded by Ollama on first run,
